---
args: {"units": "OperativeUnit[]", "tasks": "ReaderDecisionTask[]"}
returns: "ConsequenceProbe[]"
---
For each consequential decision produce ordinary and boundary situations using only the source-defined rule variables. Include unless clauses, negative requirements, deadline edge cases and genuine ambiguity. Ask what the reader may, must or must not do, not whether wording sounds clear. Keep each probe tied to its tested unit IDs; do not encode an expected answer in the situation or show the source answer to the draft reader.
